config FREETZ_PACKAGE_GRAFANA
	bool "Grafana 13.2.4"
	depends on FREETZ_TARGET_GCC_4_7_MIN
	select FREETZ_LIB_libpthread if FREETZ_TARGET_UCLIBC_HAS_multiple_libs
	select FREETZ_LIB_libdl if FREETZ_TARGET_UCLIBC_HAS_multiple_libs
	default n
	help
		Grafana is an open-source monitoring and visualization platform.
		Cross-compiles the OSS backend and installs the matching official
		frontend assets. The build downloads the Go 1.26.9 toolchain.

		Requires persistent USB storage and substantial free RAM (upstream
		recommends at least 512 MB). Externalize the binary and web assets:
		they are much too large for normal router flash memory.

		Configure through the Freetz web interface; Grafana listens on port
		3000. The service is disabled by default. Keep it on a trusted LAN.
		See https://grafana.com/oss/grafana/